# Build artifacts and installed deps must never enter the build context.
#
# Without this, `COPY apps/server apps/server` drags a stale host-built
# `dist/` into the image. The Dockerfile then runs
# `cp -r src/db/migrations dist/db/migrations`, and because dist/db/migrations
# already exists, cp NESTS the fresh copy at dist/db/migrations/migrations/
# instead of overwriting — so the app loads the stale migrations and a
# superseded 0044 tried to recreate the `duels` table, crashing on boot.
#
# Host node_modules is also wrong arch (macOS vs the Linux image) and huge;
# the image installs its own via `npm ci`.
**/node_modules
**/dist

# Git metadata, local env, editor and OS cruft — no reason to ship them.
.git
.gitignore
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea

# Local-only app data and backups must never be baked into an image.
app-data
backups
backups-dev
